    "Visual-only change: no APVTS, DSP, sampler, MIDI, preset or audio callback changes.",
    "NEON STAGE DEFAULT / SKIN-1 is the canonical default and reset target. REV.20 exact SHA 8cfd11ecce3c8039360c1c194be5251e716c9015 passed Windows x64 VST3 build, full CTest, this theme's texture/bezel/crest SVG decoding, PNG CRC/dimension validation and 16-only package staging (workflow 44717722638). Runtime-ready/selectable in REV.20. FL Studio 20 host acceptance and pluginval remain pending."
